Concretize, install, and regenerate the view for the GCC bootstrap environment
before concretizing the other seven. The downstream environments consume GCC
from that fixed view path and repeat Foundation and build-tool producer groups.
Spack 1.2 `needs` makes those concrete specs available for reuse. Review the
generated lockfiles before installation and stop if repeated producer hashes
differ. After all eight locks exist, run `python3 scripts/verify-lockfiles.py` from the
workspace root. Do not begin installation unless it passes.

The trial is CPU-only. No GPU environment or GPU module selector is rendered.

